  "title": "Aromatic Dense Irish Turkey Ham Grill",
  "description": "A festive Irish dish featuring herbal flavors and dense turkey ham, perfect for a low-glycemic diet. This recipe is ideal for a special occasion or holiday meal.",
  "cuisine": "Irish",
